:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is this Tetris?
:'''Phainon:''' Castrum Kremnos has been {{Rubi|Nikador|Strife Titan}}'s territory since ancient times. It's a massive moving fortress that surrounds the Titan, built by their followers.
:'''Phainon:''' In the age before the {{Rubi|Lance of Fury|Strife Titan}} fell from grace, Castrum Kremnos would follow the Lance into battle after battle. It's a city that enforces strict discipline and reveres military might.
