:'''Phainon:''' It's magnificent...
:'''Mydei:''' You haven't seen it at its most magnificent.
:'''Mydei:''' That's the giant sword {{Rubi|Nikador|Strife Titan}} used to destroy {{Rubi|Aquila's|Sky Titan}} heavenly kingdom long ago, followed by one city-state after another.
:'''Mydei:''' It's not just a weapon, it's the faith of the Kremnoan people. Souls who died heroically on the battlefield will further temper the blade in {{Rubi|Nikador|Strife Titan}}'s hand, becoming a part of the god-king's power.
:'''Mydei:''' Such is the Titan's conquest &mdash; {{Rubi|Nikador|Strife Titan}}, the Titankin, and the people who have faith in Strife sweep away all their enemies. Even in death, they embrace eternal glory.
:'''Phainon:''' I think you're exaggerating a little. I can think of at least three losses suffered by Castrum Kremnos in the Chrysos War, just off the top of my head.
:'''Mydei:''' There's no shame in losing to those who conspire and plot in secret. Those weak and despicable individuals are the ones who should be ashamed.
:'''Phainon:''' True. Valorous Death Before Glorious Return. The Kremnoan people have always been straightforward. They spend their whole lives running to the battlefield. No wonder {{Rubi|Zagreus|Trickery Titan}} loves teasing you.
:'''Phainon:''' ...But that's all in the past.
:'''Phainon:''' Guess what I'm thinking, Mydei?
:'''Mydei:''' Probably nothing good. Keep it simple.
:'''Phainon:''' This isn't just an expedition. It's also a battle to determine a victor. Since we're already here, why don't we have a match and fight to our heart's content?
:'''Phainon:''' Just you and me. Let's recreate the original Kremnos Festival.
:'''Phainon:''' Show me what the grandest fighting competition in Castrum Kremnos was like. Let's gild this expedition with another layer of glory and {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|compete to see who can kill the most crazed Titankin}}. How about it?
:'''Mydei:''' What's the prize?
:'''Phainon:''' The privilege of delivering the final blow to {{Rubi|Nikador|Strife Titan}}.
:'''Mydei:''' Interesting. I accept your challenge.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What about me?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Am I the referee?
:'''Phainon:''' I know Mydei. He prefers to fight alone. There are two paths ahead. (Trailblazer) and I will take the same one.
:{{tx}}

